        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "+5V : C2.1(passive) ... U1.2(VO,power_out)"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "GND : C2.2(passive) ... U1.1(GND,power_in)"}
      ],
      "impact": "The 5V rail may be unstable or oscillate, causing the ATtiny microcontrollers and other logic to malfunction or reset unpredictably.",
      "confidence": 0.9
